sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Your application
    participant Engine as RetrievalEngine
    participant Ingest as Ingestion
    participant Store as Metadata store
    participant Index as Search methods

    App->>Engine: ingest(documents, scope)
    Engine->>Engine: authorize · validate
    Engine->>Ingest: documents
    Ingest->>Store: persist documents and representations
    Engine->>Index: update enabled methods
    Index->>Store: report readiness
    Engine-->>App: IngestReport<br/>created · updated · unchanged · revived · replayed
    Note over Engine,Index: Pending work and failures remain visible in status and retrieval warnings.
